  "overview": "SPIRAL is a self-iterating autonomous development loop (Research Ã¢â€ â€™ Implement Ã¢â€ â€™ Validate). This PRD drives Spiral to improve itself: integrating newly-written lib modules into the main loop, enhancing the setup wizard to educate users about every configurable option, and adding Chrome DevTools-powered visual validation.",
