      "title": "Auto-cleanup stale spiral-worker-* branches on startup",
      "description": "Crashed runs leave behind orphaned spiral-worker-* branches. At startup of run_parallel_ralph.sh, scan for and delete any spiral-worker-* branches not checked out in any live worktree, then run worktree prune. Prevents branch accumulation that degrades git performance.",
      "priority": "high",
      "passes": true,
